{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08069","headline":"凤吹笙曲 · 李白","name":"凤吹笙曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙人十五爱吹笙，学得崑丘彩凤鸣。\n始闻链气餐金液，复道朝天赴玉京。\n玉京迢迢几千里，凤笙去去无穷已。\n欲叹离声发绦唇，更嗟别调流纤指。\n此时惜别讵堪闻，此地相看未忍分。\n重吟真曲和清吹，却奏仙歌响绿云。\n绿云紫气向函关，访道应寻缑氏山。\n莫学吹笙王子晋，一遇浮丘断不还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}